ng.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/63/7e/57/7f22a201dc3c06ceea876071117411a1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Mức độ phóng đại: 60-120 lần. Bé có thể tự điều chỉnh mức độ phóng đại bằng cách xoay mắt kính quan sát.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/df/b7/f3/2e412a7a03736b6a0876670bc32ddb5f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Quan sát vật thể bằng kính hiển vi và quay/chụp lại bằng điện thoại di động thực sự là một trải nghiệm tuyệt vời.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8e/8e/4e/711a7d96c588d2194108331c4c7038bd.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" alt=\"711a7d96c588d2194108331c4c7038bd.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/81/9b/a2/f755af776419c94b6f3415ec47d0e4ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eMột số hình ảnh vật thể quan sát được máy điện thoại chụp lại ==\u0026gt; Rất đẹp phải không?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e4/b4/d9/c1585866d5a3558d3c1791681c12f77f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/2a/ab/ea/4468bd5242218afce89ad5b1c090238c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e4/b4/d9/c1585866d5a3558d3c1791681c12f77f.png\" alt=\"c1585866d5a3558d3c1791681c12f77f.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/5b/7a/50/a3d3f6098073b25b61494a6a91b0b123.png\" alt=\"a3d3f6098073b25b61494a6a91b0b123.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/63/37/f8/48357be214da836a1072d71b5e00084c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e